Error [E0350]: Jet does not have an `Any` type
  --> tests/ui/no_any_type.jet:1:16
    |
  1 | fn show(value: Any) {
    |                ^^^
 Why: a value should keep a precise shape: use an enum for known variants, generics or traits for abstraction, `T?` for absence, and `DataTree` for parsed dynamic data
 Fix: replace `Any` with the specific mechanism for this value

Error [E0112]: `show` wants `Any` for argument 1, but this is Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/no_any_type.jet:6:10
    |
  6 |     show(1)
    |          ^
 Why: every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: use `Any` here
